    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάππειν</span></b> ) occurs in Gal.l.c. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>phlegm</i>, <i><span class="en">
